<title>SLOVAKIA: SLOVAK CEN BANK HOLDS OVERNIGHT REPO TENDER.</title>
<headline>SLOVAK CEN BANK HOLDS OVERNIGHT REPO TENDER.</headline>
<dateline>BRATISLAVA 1997-06-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The National Bank of Slovakia (NBS) said on Wednesday it would hold an overnight repo tender to add liquidity to the interbank market at a fixed volume of 4.5 billion crowns.</p>
<p>The NBS added that the American style tender would be held at 0800 GMT.</p>
<p>The Slovak central bank does not set minimum or maximum prices on bids.</p>
<p>-- Robin Shepherd, Bratislava Newsroom, 421-7-521-8402</p>
